  name is phone 1, the second phone 2, and so on.

  To swap in the real cast:
    1. replace the names below, keeping six per table
    2. drop square photos in as res/drawable-nodpi/avatar_t<table>_p<phone>.png
       (avatar_t2_p3.png is the third player at table two)
  Nothing else needs changing - the app reads the length of these lists.
-->
